	CIFMNU		/CHANGE INSTRUCTION FIELD TO MENU
	JMS I IOACAL	/CALL IOA					A008
		0	/						A008
		TARTN	/DISPLAY PRESS RETURN TO TRY ANOTHER NAME	A008
		2005	/LINE TO DISPLAY 				A008
